WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,010
four thousand

2
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:12,470
It wasn't so expensive yesterday

3
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:15,920
The price has increased again after timeout

4
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,400
It would be great if we could buy it

5
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:27,620
eldest daughter

6
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:28,860
Why did you come down alone?

7
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,860
Everyone else in the family is looking after the children.

8
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:31,940
I can come down alone

9
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:34,060
Then you have worked hard enough. My surname is Zhou.

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:35,460
Just call me Aunt Zhou from now on.

11
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:37,570
I'm the only one in my house now

12
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:39,330
A few years ago, my wife and son were no longer here.

13
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:40,650
There's no one to talk to

14
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:43,050
So I’m a person who fishes out people whenever I see them, so don’t bother me first.

15
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:44,930
This aunt is really unguarded

16
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:46,810
He even revealed that he lives alone
